--- !u!114 &1490253083
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1490253081}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4144f17c33745f4428551225776b4b3d, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Main::NarrativeTutorialManager
  tutorialSteps:
  - speaker: 5
    note: Welcome
    layoutMode: 0
    lines:
    - text: Welcome to the walkthrough!
      expression: 1
      isAction: 0
    - text: Since you needed some help learning the ropes, we are going to teach
        you.
      expression: 0
      isAction: 0
    - text: I need you to lock in for me!
      expression: 4
      isAction: 0
    highlightTargets: []
    uiHighlightTargets: []
    pearlRewardOnComplete: 0
  - speaker: 2
    note: Inventory
    layoutMode: 1
    lines:
    - text: First, we need to get you some ore.
      expression: 0
      isAction: 0
    - text: Click the next day button to get 10 of those beautiful pieces of ore
      expression: 1
      isAction: 0
    highlightTargets: []
    uiHighlightTargets: []
    pearlRewardOnComplete: 0
  - speaker: 4
    note: Resources
    layoutMode: 0
    lines:
    - text: Now, let's head into the forge.
      expression: 0
      isAction: 0
    - text: Hover over this building and click the craft button that pops up.
      expression: 4
      isAction: 0
    highlightTargets: []
    uiHighlightTargets:
    - {fileID: 0}
    - {fileID: 0}
    pearlRewardOnComplete: 0
  - speaker: 5
    note: Turn Counter
    layoutMode: 0
    lines:
    - text: That counter tracks how far you've gone.
      expression: 0
      isAction: 0
    - text: And how close everything is to becoming a very expensive volcanic cautionary
        tale.
      expression: 5
      isAction: 0
    - text: So yes, time matters.
      expression: 4
      isAction: 0
    highlightTargets: []
    uiHighlightTargets:
    - {fileID: 0}
    pearlRewardOnComplete: 0
  - speaker: 5
    note: Enemy Gauge
    layoutMode: 1
    lines:
    - text: That gauge is bad news, in a nicely organized format.
      expression: 0
      isAction: 0
    - text: It means a troublesome visitor is getting closer.
      expression: 4
      isAction: 0
    - text: When that fills up, the day tends to become memorable in the wrong way.
      expression: 5
      isAction: 0
    highlightTargets: []
    uiHighlightTargets:
    - {fileID: 0}
    pearlRewardOnComplete: 0
  - speaker: 5
    note: Next Day Button
    layoutMode: 1
    lines:
    - text: And that button sends you into the next day.
      expression: 0
      isAction: 0
    - text: "Useful, dangerous, unavoidable \u2014 just like scheduling."
      expression: 5
      isAction: 0
    - text: Try not to press it before you're ready.
      expression: 1
      isAction: 0
    highlightTargets: []
    uiHighlightTargets:
    - {fileID: 0}
    pearlRewardOnComplete: 0
  - speaker: 5
    note: Buildings Overview
    layoutMode: 0
    lines:
    - text: Now, the buildings.
      expression: 0
      isAction: 0
    - text: These five keep the whole settlement moving.
      expression: 1
      isAction: 0
    - text: Go in, look around, and say hello to the residents when you can.
      expression: 4
      isAction: 0
    - text: They all have opinions. Some of them are even useful.
      expression: 5
      isAction: 0
    highlightTargets:
    - {fileID: 0}
    - {fileID: 0}
    - {fileID: 0}
    - {fileID: 0}
    - {fileID: 0}
    uiHighlightTargets: []
    pearlRewardOnComplete: 0
  - speaker: 5
    note: NPC Hint
    layoutMode: 0
    lines:
    - text: One last thing.
      expression: 4
      isAction: 0
    - text: If you spot someone out on the map and stop to talk, something unusual
        might happen.
      expression: 1
      isAction: 0
    - text: Could be helpful. Could be expensive. That's community life.
      expression: 5
      isAction: 0
    - text: Anyway, I really do need to get back to work. Good luck.
      expression: 1
      isAction: 0
    highlightTargets: []
    uiHighlightTargets: []
    pearlRewardOnComplete: 0
